                <div class="se-component se-text se-l-default" id="SE-e9d821f2-7f95-4eb3-bb9c-33f581688a2b">
                    <div class="se-component-content">
                        <div class="se-section se-section-text se-l-default">
                            <div class="se-module se-module-text">
                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " style="" id="SE-f8e66074-77ee-48ff-b975-4d8840be2b31"><span style="" class="se-fs- se-ff-   " id="SE-a27aeb47-6d02-4c5b-b436-8aa4e43b1c08"><b>종합과세는 아직 먼 얘기예요</b></span></p>
<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " style="" id="SE-a098e1b1-f84e-4944-8fe3-c6edde5ae449"><span style="" class="se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  " id="SE-8cbaaab8-7019-4598-993f-573a20f826c1">​</span></p>
<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " style="" id="SE-0a77b1e6-d066-4620-b16b-cc3c84e3578a"><span style="" class="se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  " id="SE-a55d6f31-3237-4732-a749-299b6a5d143e">원래 예금 이자에서 15.4%를 떼고 주는데, 1년 이자와 배당을 합쳐 2천만원을 넘기면 다른 소득과 합쳐 세금을 다시 매겨요.</span></p>
<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " style="" id="SE-87d07010-0cec-4a9b-9abf-cb67aa6311a7"><span style="" class="se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  " id="SE-c6c7105d-3c09-4fa0-9d6f-cafb108e442f">​</span></p>
<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " style="" id="SE-381db377-63ce-4b32-bef3-e4a92740c747"><span style="" class="se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  " id="SE-99be9d23-8681-4c3c-bcfa-ae74b32cc95f">3억이면 가장 높은 금리로 넣어도 이자가 2천만원에 한참 못 미쳐서, 종합과세 걱정은 안 하셔도 돼요. 가장 높은 금리로 계산해도 원금이 5억원은 넘어야 이 기준선에 걸립니다.</span></p>
<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " style="" id="SE-9396c8e8-b578-4ee3-8bf6-9856859f759d"><span style="" class="se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  " id="SE-ff44b5d7-86b1-445c-83c7-6a88f3955037">​</span></p>
<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " style="" id="SE-81886485-ff87-42f3-8c7a-49d78bda5d9c"><span style="" class="se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  " id="SE-1e6cbccf-a481-4590-9951-b84380b250c4">주식 배당금을 따로 받고 계신다면 그 금액까지 꼭 합쳐서 따져 보셔야 해요.</span></p>
<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " style="" id="SE-a2ba2136-b5bf-47ce-a27e-c3863e1ec72e"><span style="" class="se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  " id="SE-2d5b44be-6cb8-4894-884f-eff48573f065">​</span></p>
<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " style="" id="SE-d5567379-1686-429b-968f-3567e35d8de3"><span style="" class="se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  " id="SE-39f56de6-cde0-47d5-86e9-9f4b3187d96a">---</span></p>
<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " style="" id="SE-57bbd115-7483-4628-a4a4-9cf90b56a3d6"><span style="" class="se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  " id="SE-f44fed83-3db7-4520-b5d7-b9033bee9e55">확인한 곳</span></p>
